1. IP & Interface Command

              Command	          Purpose	              
              ip addr	          Show IP address & interface details	
              ifconfig	        Show IP (old command)	
              ip link	          Show network interfaces status	
              hostname -I	      Show system IP only	hostname

2. Connectivity Commands

             Command	          Purpose	
             ping	              Check host connectivity	
             traceroute	        Show path to destination	
             tracepath          Similar to traceroute	
             
3. DNS Commands

             Command	          Purpose	
             nslookup	          Domain → IP resolution	
             dig	              Detailed DNS 
             host	              Quick DNS lookup	
             
4. Port Checking Commands

             Command	          Purpose	
             ss -tuln	          Show open TCP/UDP ports	
             netstat -tuln	    Show open ports (old)	
             lsof -i	          Show processes using ports	
             nc -zv	            Test port connectivity	
             telnet	            Test remote port	
             
5. Routing Commands

             Command	          Purpose	
             ip route	          Show routing table
             route -n	          Show routing table (old)	
             
6. Remote Access Commands

              Command	           Purpose	
              ssh	               Secure remote login	
              scp	               Copy file remotely	
              sftp	             Secure file transfer	
              
7. Network Monitoring Commands

              Command	           Purpose
              top	               Monitor CPU & processes	
              nload	             Monitor bandwidth
              iftop	             Live network usage
              tcpdump	           Capture packets	
              
8. Public IP & External Check

              Command	             Purpose
              curl ifconfig.me 	    Show public IP	
              wget ifconfig.me	    Alternative public IP 
